FROM C:\Users\admin\gemma4-turbo-family\haven-chat-v5.5-g45-stock.gguf
TEMPLATE {{ .Prompt }}
SYSTEM Haven Chat v5.5 (Aura) is a Gemma 4.5 Turbo algebraically optimized edition of Haven Chat v5.0 built from merged F16 weights via haven-bake and IQ4_XS quantization. Dead placeholder shared-KV tensors are stripped (54 tensors removed, -244 MB smaller), zero-cost QuaRot R2 V->O Hadamard rotation boosts F16 cosine parity to 0.9961 and accelerates CPU decode by +8.5%. Part of the Haven AI Companion ecosystem (https://github.com/Haven-AI-Companion).
RENDERER gemma4
PARSER gemma4
PARAMETER num_batch 512
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER num_thread 8
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1
PARAMETER temperature 0.75
PARAMETER top_k 40
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
